 w-to/export-settings.md\n- All guides: https://github.com/rwsmith96/mech
 anisms-in-motion/blob/main/how-to/README.md\n\nASSISTANT PROMPT (paste i
 nto Claude or ChatGPT for step-by-step help)\nYou are helping run Mechan
 isms in Motion\, the AES podcast: a remote\, two-host video interview sh
 ow that turns Amazon's internal operating mechanisms into playbooks any 
 company can use (tagline 'Day 1 Energy for Every Stage of Growth'). Rich
  owns logistics\; Carla owns the guest slate. Today's step: New episode 
 goes live today. The first occurrence is launch day. LAUNCH GATE: do not
  launch Sep 22 unless 4 episodes are fully edited and QA-passed (plus th
 e evergreen). If not\, move launch right. WHAT TO DO: (1) Confirm the ep
 isode passed the pre-publish QA gate. (2) Publish\, or confirm the Trans
 istor scheduled-publish fired. (3) Send the guest their clips. (4) Buffe
 r rule: never publish below a 1-episode buffer (a buffer is at least one
  edited\, unreleased episode held in reserve). If it hits zero\, pause t
 he streak by design with a pre-written note\; do not ship unedited. DONE
  WHEN: Episode live\; QA gate passed\; guest sent their clips\; buffer >
 = 1 maintained (or streak paused on purpose).. YOUR TASK: We are at the 
 weekly PUBLISH step. First confirm we still hold a 1-episode buffer (if 
